$$\mathcal{H}_{\text{WDW}} \Psi [g_{ij}, \Phi] = \left[ -16\pi G G_{ijkl} \frac{\delta^2}{\delta g_{ij} مشکوک \delta g_{kk}} - \frac{\sqrt{g}}{16\pi G} (R - 2\Lambda) + \mathcal{H}_{\text{matter}} \right] \Psi [g_{ij}, \Phi] = 0$$

